# Diamond QC v3

Before major PR or production deploy, run the checklist in [`docs/protocol/diamond-qc-v3.md`](../../docs/protocol/diamond-qc-v3.md).

**Do not develop during QC.** Measure → evidence → conclusion → minimal fix only.

**Axioms:** HTTP 200 ≠ content correctness · Build PASS ≠ domain model · confidence ends at deploy.

**Production:** split **Availability** (HTTP) vs **Identity** (metadata / ORIGIN vs SCENARIO).

Identity layers (verify independently): **ORIGIN** · **SCENARIO** · **LOCATION** · **FIXTURES**.

**Domain Identity Leak** = scenario in global product metadata — semantic error, severity often **Medium**.
